      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0010",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "Access to the socket is provided so that it can be used as a kqueue event source, a CFRunLoop event source, in a select() loop, etc.",
      "normalizedSource": "Access to the socket is provided so that it can be used as a kqueue event source, a CFRunLoop event source, in a select() loop, etc.",
